# .okignore -- paths excluded from the OpenKnowledge document index.
# Evaluated together with .gitignore (gitignore syntax).
#
# _scratch/ is gitignored, which would also hide it from OpenKnowledge.
# Re-include it so personal scratch notes can be edited and searched in OK.
!_scratch/
!_scratch/*/
!_scratch/**

# Claude Code entry file; not a knowledge page
CLAUDE.md

# GitHub pull request template; not a knowledge page
.github/pull_request_template.md
